{
  "uid": "pgdelta-evidence",
  "title": "pgdelta: measured latency evidence (EXP-12, -28, -57)",
  "description": "The committed results of the slowdown experiments, backfilled from docs/experiments/data/*.csv by infra/observability/backfill.py. These are session aggregates, not live samples: the metric names are prefixed pgdelta_evidence_ to keep them apart, and each series is a flat line across the wall-clock window its session actually ran in. The write-ups are the authority; this is a reading aid. Set the dashboard's time range to 'October 2026' to see all three sessions.",
  "tags": ["pgdelta", "latency", "evidence", "backfilled"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": { "from": "2026-10-24T18:00:00.000Z", "to": "2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**O4's bar is `pg_basebackup` under the same load**, not zero. An arm meets it when its work lost is within max(0.05 s, 0.15 x full's) and its worst drop within 0.03 of `pg_basebackup`'s.\n\n- **EXP-28** (Oct 25): v1 reading a live busy primary, by source worker count. The cliff between `v1_j2` and `v1_j4` is why live mode now defaults to at most 2 workers on 8 vCPUs.\n- **EXP-12** (Oct 24): T10a, with v1 measured only by proxy; carries p50 as well, and the only committed `moderate` load block.\n- **EXP-57** (Oct 27): the start checkpoint on ~5 GB of dirty buffers. **Its two O4 numbers disagree** - `fast` has the worse drop, `spread` the larger total loss - and which one governs is still open."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "EXP-28: p95 latency by arm (unthrottled) - the worker-count cliff",
      "description": "load only 5.3 ms, pg_basebackup 6.4 ms, v1 at 1-2 workers 6.6-7.4 ms, v1 at 4 workers 74.3 ms.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "pgdelta-prom" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 15 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "pgdelta-prom" },
          "expr": "pgdelta_evidence_latency_ms{experiment=\"EXP-28\",quantile=\"0.95\",speed=\"unthrottled\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{arm}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
